# Shadcn First UI Components

- Use existing shadcn/ui components before writing custom markup or custom controls.
- Prefer composition of existing primitives (`Tabs`, `Table`, `Pagination`, `Dialog`, `Button`, etc.).
- Only build custom UI elements when no suitable shadcn component exists or the user explicitly asks for custom UI.
- When using a component category, check and follow current shadcn docs/API first.
- Keep styling additive: layout-oriented `className` customizations are fine, but avoid replacing core component behavior.
